[{"id":"MTk-q01","number":1,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi : Fe(CO)<sub>5</sub> + 2PF<sub>3</sub>&nbsp; + H<sub>2</sub>&nbsp;<img title=\"\\rightarrow\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\rightarrow\" /> Fe(CO)<sub>2</sub>(PF<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>(H)<sub>2</sub> + 3CO</p><p>Berapa mol CO yang dapat dihasilkan dari campuran pereaksi 5,0 mol Fe(CO)<sub>5</sub>, 8,0 mol PF<sub>3</sub>, dan 6,0 mol H<sub>2</sub>?</p><p>A.&nbsp;24 mol</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->B.&nbsp;5,0 mol</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->C.&nbsp;12 mol</p><p>D. 15 mol</p><p>E.&nbsp; 6,0 mol</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTQ1"},{"id":"MTk-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berdasarkan informasi berikut ini, hitunglah masssa atom rata-rata berat dari unsur X:</p><p>Isotop %&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; kelimpahan Relatif&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Massa eksak (amu)</p><p>&nbsp; <sup>221</sup>X&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 74,22&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;220,9</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<sup>220</sup>X&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 12,78&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;220,0</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<sup>218</sup>X&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;13,00&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;218,1</p>","choices":["220,4 amu","219,7 amu","204,2 amu","218,5 amu","220,9 amu"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTUw"},{"id":"MTk-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pasangan berikut ini manakah yang merupakan isotop unsur :&nbsp;</p>","choices":["2211X, 7938X2+</p><p>&nbsp;","9645X, 11692X</p><p>&nbsp;","11692X2+, 12289X2+</p><p>&nbsp;","&nbsp;23399X2+, 11692X</p><p>&nbsp;","&nbsp;23399X2+,&nbsp;11692X4+"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTg0"},{"id":"MTk-q04","number":4,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi dibawah ini yang entalpi reaksinya (DHr) merupakan entalpi pembentukan senyawa (DHf) adalah:</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->A.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2AI_{(s)}&amp;space;+&amp;space;3CI_{2(g)}\\rightarrow&amp;space;2AICl_{3(g)}\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>B.<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_{(s)}&amp;space;+&amp;space;O_{2(g)}\\rightarrow&amp;space;CO_{2(g)}\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>C.<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_{2(g)}&amp;space;+&amp;space;3H_{2(g)}\\rightarrow&amp;space;2NH_{3(g)}\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>D.<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2C_{(s)}&amp;space;+&amp;space;O_{2(g)}\\rightarrow&amp;space;2CO_{(g)}\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>E.<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2S_{(s)}&amp;space;+&amp;space;3O_{2(g)}\\rightarrow&amp;space;2SO_{3(g)}\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTg1"},{"id":"MTk-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; tab-stops: 26.05pt; margin: 9.1pt 15.0pt .0001pt 26.0pt;\">Dari reaksi kesetimbangan dibawah ini, manakah yang kesetimbangannya tidak dipengaruhi oleh perubahan<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.2pt;\">&nbsp;t</span>ekanan</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img title=\"Fe_{3}O4_{(s)} + H_{2(g)}_{\\leftarrow }^{\\rightarrow }\\textrm{}3 FeO_{(s)} + H_{2}O_{(g)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Fe_{3}O4_{(s)}&amp;space;+&amp;space;H_{2(g)}_{\\leftarrow&amp;space;}^{\\rightarrow&amp;space;}\\textrm{}3&amp;space;FeO_{(s)}&amp;space;+&amp;space;H_{2}O_{(g)}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"CH_{3}OH_{(1)} _{\\leftarrow }^{\\rightarrow }\\textrm{}{}CO_{(g)} + 2H_{2}_{(g)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_{3}OH_{(1)}&amp;space;_{\\leftarrow&amp;space;}^{\\rightarrow&